1. GRANT OF LICENCE
   Subject to payment of the applicable fees and to the terms below, Appsgain
   Technologies grants you a non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to install
   and use the RecoverX software ("the Software") in accordance with your
   edition:

     Free          No fee. Personal, non-commercial use, and evaluation of the
                   Software by anyone. Recovery is capped as described below.
     Professional  Unlimited recovery on one computer at a time, for personal,
                   non-commercial use.
     Business      Unlimited recovery on up to three computers at a time, for
                   use, including commercial use, inside one organisation.
     Technician    Unlimited recovery on any number of computers, including
                   your clients' computers, to provide data-recovery services.
     Enterprise    Volume licensing under a separately negotiated agreement.

   The Free edition recovers at most 1 GiB (1,073,741,824 bytes) of data in
   total on each computer. That total counts every recovery made on the
   computer, including any made while a paid licence was active on it.

   A paid licence runs for the term stated when it is bought, one year unless
   agreed otherwise, and may be renewed. If it ends without being renewed, the
   Software continues to work as the Free edition.

